gvproxy
Copyright The gvisor-tap-vsock Authors (https://github.com/containers/gvisor-tap-vsock)

Nido ships the unmodified gvproxy binary from the gvisor-tap-vsock release
pinned in release.json (version, URL, size and SHA-256), re-signed with
Nido's identity. gvproxy is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0;
the full text is in the LICENSE file next to this one.

The upstream repository has no NOTICE file. The binary embeds the Go modules
below (read from the build information of the pinned binary with its module
list, so they are exactly the ones compiled in). Each entry gives the module,
its version, its licence and where the source is. Licence texts follow the
list; modules under the Apache License 2.0 use the text in the LICENSE file
next to this one. Licence texts were fetched from each project's repository at
the version shown.

